    "Revision 2 drops rect-image-vf. In the read run of 2026-10-19, vs.GetVectorFill of rect-image-ov returned the image name and vs.GetFPat returned the negative index. rect-image-vf returned no fill name and vs.GetFPat 1, a solid fill."
